@anon.9efbc0c128adab6190fabe7f7e045142.971 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [500 x i8] }> <{ [500 x i8] c"Converts a value to a stroke or constructs a stroke with the given\0Aparameters.\0A\0ANote that in most cases you do not need to convert values to strokes in\0Aorder to use them, as they will be converted automatically. However,\0Athis constructor can be useful to ensure a value has all the fields of a\0Astroke.\0A\0A```example\0A#let my-func(x) = {\0A    x = stroke(x) // Convert to a stroke\0A    [Stroke has thickness #x.thickness.]\0A}\0A#my-func(3pt) \\\0A#my-func(red) \\\0A#my-func(stroke(cap: \22round\22, thickness: 1pt))\0A```" }>, align 1
